<div class="wp-block-group tt-wrap"><!-- wp:heading {"level":2,"className":"tt-h2 tt-isec__h"} -->
<h2 class="wp-block-heading tt-h2 tt-isec__h">A day at the Ashby Vale office</h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph {"className":"tt-ilede tt-ilede--sm"} -->
<p class="tt-ilede tt-ilede--sm">Our daily routine at eighteen Platform Lane reflects the rhythm of school travel. Work begins at eight thirty with the formal duty line handover from the overnight leader. From nine o'clock, our team conducts planning calls with schools and prepares customized proposals. Eleven o'clock is dedicated to reviewing site-specific risk assessments. At fourteen hundred hours, Tomás manages coach and flight bookings, while Priya answers parent questions at sixteen hundred hours. The office closes at seventeen thirty, though our duty line remains active throughout the night.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:html -->
<ul class="tt-trows"><li><time>08:30</time><span>Duty line handover from the night leader</span></li><li><time>09:00</time><span>Proposals and calls with schools</span></li><li><time>11:00</time><span>Risk assessments</span></li><li><time>14:00</time><span>Coach and flight bookings</span></li><li><time>16:00</time><span>Parents’ questions</span></li><li><time>17:30</time><span>Office closes; the duty line stays open</span></li></ul>
<!-- /wp:html --></div>
<!-- /wp:group --></div>
