<!-- wp:heading {"level":2,"className":"tt-request__h"} -->
<h2 class="wp-block-heading tt-request__h">18 Platform Lane,<br>Ashby Vale</h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph {"className":"tt-request__p"} -->
<p class="tt-request__p">We welcome visits from teachers and educational visit coordinators wishing to discuss itineraries in person. Our office is located at eighteen Platform Lane in Ashby Vale, just a six-minute walk from Ashby Vale railway station, with two dedicated visitor parking spaces on site. We are open Monday to Friday from eight thirty to seventeen thirty, and closed on weekends and public holidays. During all student trips, our emergency duty line at plus forty-four one six three two nine six zero four nine nine operates continuously.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

